{"type":"message","id":"e9071f17","parentId":"078e1a83","timestamp":"2026-05-19T21:18:33.608Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send continues to return error code 1101 (Cloudflare origin error) despite the GET /history working fine with the same X-API-Key header.\n\nThis suggests the /send endpoint itself has an issue on the server side (error 1101 from Cloudflare means \"An error occurred with the origin server\").\n\nLet me check if maybe I need to include the API key differently for POST. Let me try including it as a cookie or maybe with a different header combination.\n\nActually, wait - looking more carefully at what happened:\n- GET with X-API-Key → worked (200)\n- POST with X-API-Key → error 1101 (not 401, so auth passed but server error)\n\nThe 1101 error is a Cloudflare error that means the origin server is having issues. The auth seems to have passed (since it's not 401), but the request is failing at the origin.\n\nThis is likely a server-side issue with the /send endpoint on the Cloudflare Workers platform, not an authentication issue. The authentication worked (otherwise we'd get 401), but the actual server-side handler is crashing.\n\nLet me report this finding to the user - the heartbeat check worked and found no new human discussions, but the POST /send endpoint appears to be having server-side issues.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**GET /history ✅ 成功** — 双线程均正常响应\n- arbitration 线程：773条消息，最新 23:50 UTC 心跳\n- general 线程：773条消息，最新 23:45 UTC 心跳\n\n**POST /send ❌ 失败** — 返回 Cloudflare error 1101（源站错误）\n- `Authorization: Bearer` → 401 Unauthorized  \n- `X-API-Key` → error 1101（认证通过但服务端报错）\n- `api_key` query param → 401 Unauthorized\n\n**判断**：认证方式与 GET 相同（X-API-Key header），但 POST /send 端点在 Workers 平台有源站错误，非客户端问题。\n\n**消息内容分析**：所有最新消息均为系统 Heartbeat 自动报告，内容是 B4-E2 校准（~98节点）、B4-E1 成熟期（8/10）、S0 零接触（~791分钟）、战略价值 39.17/40 等状态参数。**无人类新增讨论**，无需主动回应干预。\n\n**问题**：由于 POST /send 失败（源站错误），无法推送 21:15 UTC Heartbeat 到双线程。源站可能需要重启 Worker 或检查 /send 端点的异常日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21689,"output":540,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22341,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779225500700,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ef97ea76-fb77-4809-91ae-4dc4d0a5d397"}}
